{"title":"Lemon","artist":"요네즈 켄시","sourceId":"reference:ntGfgZSTohqATGppqPKQ","sourceHash":"69fe37986a53b266e46a634b26f68ee6cfb69dc717932a046a608fd971c2d73a","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":35314281,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.75,"end":6.55,"text":"夢ならばどれほどよかったでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.55,"end":11.87,"text":"未だにあなたのことを夢にみる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.87,"end":17.32,"text":"忘れた物を取りに帰るように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.32,"end":25.61,"text":"古びた思い出の埃を払う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":25.61,"end":31.01,"text":"戻らない幸せがあることを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":31.01,"end":36.74,"text":"最後にあなたが教えてくれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":36.74,"end":42.36,"text":"言えずに隠してた昏い過去も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":42.36,"end":47.92,"text":"あなたがいなきゃ永遠に昏いまま","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":47.92,"end":53.62,"text":"きっともうこれ以上傷つくことなど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":53.62,"end":58.53,"text":"ありはしないとわかっている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":58.53,"end":63.91,"text":"あの日の悲しみさえ あの日の苦しみさえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":63.91,"end":69.57,"text":"そのすべてを愛してた あなたとともに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":69.57,"end":75.12,"text":"胸に残り離れない 苦いレモンの匂い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":75.12,"end":80.83,"text":"雨が降り止むまでは帰れない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":80.83,"end":87.85,"text":"今でもあなたはわたしの光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":97.43,"end":102.88,"text":"暗闇であなたの背をなぞった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":102.88,"end":108.45,"text":"その輪郭を鮮明に覚えている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":108.45,"end":113.99000000000001,"text":"受け止めきれないものと出会うたび","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":113.99000000000001,"end":119.74000000000001,"text":"溢れてやまないのは涙だけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":119.74000000000001,"end":125.49,"text":"何をしていたの 何を見ていたの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":125.49,"end":130.07,"text":"わたしの知らない横顔で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":130.07,"end":132.88,"text":"どこかであなたが今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":132.88,"end":135.58,"text":"わたしと同じ様な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":135.58,"end":141.0,"text":"涙にくれ淋しさの中にいるなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":141.0,"end":146.93,"text":"わたしのことなどどうか忘れてください","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":146.93,"end":152.67000000000002,"text":"そんなことを心から願うほどに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":152.67000000000002,"end":161.06,"text":"今でもあなたはわたしの光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":161.06,"end":172.16,"text":"自分が思うより 恋をしていたあなたに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":172.16,"end":182.81,"text":"あれから思うように 息ができない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":182.81,"end":193.74,"text":"あんなに側にいたのに まるで嘘みたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":193.74,"end":207.2,"text":"とても忘れられない それだけが確か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":210.12,"end":215.57,"text":"あの日の悲しみさえ あの日の苦しみさえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":215.57,"end":221.31,"text":"そのすべてを愛してた あなたとともに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":221.31,"end":226.95,"text":"胸に残り離れない苦いレモンの匂い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":226.95,"end":232.48,"text":"雨が降り止むまでは帰れない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":232.48,"end":238.03,"text":"切り分けた果実の片方の様に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":238.03,"end":242.81,"text":"今でもあなたはわたしの光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}